        "Lower tension.",
        "Use hybrid.",
        "Evaluate racquet change only if discomfort remains."
      ]
    },

    "if_current_racquet_is_flexible": {
      "action": "Do not automatically maximize string softness.",
      "note": "A very flexible racquet combined with an extremely soft stringbed can become too vague or unstable for some players."
